index 0000000000..6796f32018
--- /dev/null
+++ b/releasenotes/notes/l3-ha-router-delete-after-failed-initialize-e4fce5e2b1a94d7b.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    When an HA router failed to initialize after the L3 agent had read its
+    HA port but before it had created the keepalived manager, for example
+    because the HA port had no fixed IP, the agent's cleanup failed with an
+    ``AttributeError`` and skipped the rest of the router deletion,
+    including disabling radvd. The cleanup now skips the keepalived state
+    change monitor, which was never started, and deletes the rest of the
+    router.
